goto.help.walk=goto <x> <y> <z> | goto <x> <z> - walk to a cell, or to the surface of a column
goto.help.fly=goto fly <x> <y> <z> - glide there with the elytra (fireworks taken from the inventory)
goto.help.ride=goto ride <x> <z> - get on the nearest boat, minecart or horse and drive
goto.help.smart=goto smart <x> <y> <z> - choose walking, riding or flying by distance
goto.help.nodig=nodig - plan around blocks instead of breaking them (add it to a walk)
goto.help.stop=goto stop - abort the trip and release the keys
goto.help.status=goto status - steps taken, replans, and where the body is heading
goto.help.help=goto help - this list
superpearl.help.back=sp back [name] - walk to the button and press it (the only button, or 'base', when unnamed)
superpearl.help.set=sp set <name> <x> <y> <z> [face|auto] - store a button; the face is read from the block unless given
superpearl.help.del=sp del <name> - forget a button
superpearl.help.list=sp list - show the buttons and the park point
superpearl.help.return=sp return [<x> <y> <z>|off] - show, set or clear the place the bot parks after pressing
superpearl.help.toggle=sp on | sp off - enable or disable 'sp back'
superpearl.help.status=sp status - what the action is doing, and what is configured
superpearl.help.stop=sp stop - abort the running action and release the keys
superpearl.help.reload=sp reload - re-read superpearl.yml
